      "created_at": "2014-08-22T14:31:59.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>While planning out some potential new projects I was looking at a couple of heroes and noticed that we never see in detail a full image of Parse.<br>\nWe can see her skirt, but not the bottom of it (except for billowing up movement in places), nor her feet, other than in one silhouette image where we can see her feet are visible below the skirt.<br>\nWhat does she wear on her feet?</p>\n<p>Are there any other prominent characters where we are lacking some view of part of them or don’t have a full idea of what their costume is?<br>\nFor some forms of fan art it could be useful to know which characters you might need to fudge some elements a little on.</p>\n<p>Also, feel free to correct me if I have missed her feet somewhere.</p>\n<p>Also also, yay, this is the first topic I’ve started.</p>",
